<title>USA: RSI says completes private placement.</title>
<headline>RSI says completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>RSI Systems Inc said it completed the private placement of 1.5 million shares of its common stock at $3 per share.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of $4 million will be used to fund further research and development of the company's videoconferencing systems, sales and marketing expenses, capital equipment, inventory, financing of accounts receivable, and working capital and general corporate purposes, it said.</p>
<p>RSI makes systems for full-motion video and audio communication, document collaboration and high-speed file transfer.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
